cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Use the metadata below to cite this repository."
type: software
title: "warp-drive: Warp Engine — a computable feasibility audit of an Alcubierre warp drive"
abstract: >-
  A flat-slice 3+1 ADM solver checked against the energy density in Alcubierre
  (1994, eq. 18). The audit computes the total Eulerian energy for several wall
  profiles, bubble sizes, and speeds. It also estimates the energy for specified
  Planck-scale wall thicknesses motivated by the work of Pfenning and Ford.
authors:
  - name: "zdltvxq"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-20"
url: "https://github.com/zdltvxq/warp-drive"
repository-code: "https://github.com/zdltvxq/warp-drive"
license: MIT
